{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infection has struck the body! As the mighty T-Cell, it's your duty to eradicate the invading pathogens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume pathogens to earn mito energy, and use it to purchase upgrades and summon allies in your battle to protect the body. If all your body cells die, it's game over for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilising squishy softbody physics and hand-drawn graphics, this game will take you on a journey through the body. As you clean up infections, you gather more knowledge about your pathogenic enemies, building an encyclopedia of knowledge. As you obtain more mito, you grow stronger, better able to take on the legions of viruses and bacteria that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, mighty T-Cell! Save the body from certain demise!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/a1642a8b3c6406485268abb3712acbc22dfa011a.jpg"},{"name":"First Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/d4656fb61386abc026d02fe544d11b63e54190a4.jpg"},{"name":"Max Resilience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/548bbc34505add40769a2a4cc721837e83666e14.jpg"},{"name":"Binge Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/7c0acce21a4c4a0bd30c06d6dd541412219301f5.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of all-trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/590456cb43960721497b37817c428f561206e24a.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/ac24d3e63ea6e0d88156e2033d2d0d8e4cec25ce.jpg"},{"name":"Speedster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894780/0bc21cf3cb08c5e1e2f4826eebb79c3486e58694.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://s